Package: curfew
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), systemd, iptables
Recommends: avahi-daemon, network-manager
Maintainer: Sharjeel Mazhar <sharjeelmazhar@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/sharjeelmazhar/Curfew
Description: See and control this computer from a paired phone at home
 The laptop side of Curfew. A paired Android phone on the same Wi-Fi can see
 who is logged in, shut the computer down now or after a countdown, lock or
 log out an account, let an account in without its password being typed, and
 turn the internet off for one account.
 .
 Installing this package also adds the Curfew package source, so later
 versions arrive with "sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade".
